        "name": "Belle Sorciere",
        "username": "Belle_Sorciere",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/belle_sorciere/{size}/1982_2.png",
        "created_at": "2016-05-03T00:58:19.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"poypoyking\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/p/ecd19e/48.png\" class=\"avatar\"> poypoyking:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Anyone else ready to play Oblivaeon?&nbsp; :)&nbsp;A long wait yet - thankfully the hero pack will spice things up a bit for a little while.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>I am&nbsp;<strong>so</strong> ready.</p>\n<p>I will continue to be ready for another eight months.</p>",
