        "id": 169544,
        "name": "speedyolrac",
        "username": "speedyolrac",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/speedyolrac/{size}/1918_2.png",
        "created_at": "2016-05-03T21:10:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I am very excited to see the art, the flavor text and all the hidden lore. I am blown away the 5 years ago there had aeon men shown with the first set. I can't wait for FotNote to spend all his time doing all the work and me just reading his lore theories. Hmm fun times.</p><p>And for Freedom Five Annual #30, hmm comic is going to be read so much. I wonder if we can get them to print #1 too. I really just want Darkwatch #7.</p><p>Also I want a Framed full size ¿Quando? ¡Ahorra!, or maybe i should just frame the one i do have.</p><p>So hopefull those play tester are not tired of cuting up serval hundered pages of cards, and find time to accualy play the game. It would sure suck if they just finish cutting only to have a new version out. . . And pray that Fixer, Greazer and Fixed Point do not break the game again. For beign a \"useless\" hero, Mr. Fixer sure does break the game a lot.&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
